<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <title>Doctolib 404</title>
  <link href="/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" />
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="ROBOTS" content="NOINDEX, NOFOLLOW" />
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Roboto';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('Roboto'), local('Roboto-Regular'), url(/fonts/font-roboto-regular.ttf) format('truetype');
    }

    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Montserrat';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-display: swap;
      src: local('Montserrat Bold'), local('Montserrat-Bold'), url(/fonts/font-montserrat-bold.ttf) format('truetype');
    }

    html {
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      height: 100vh;

      background-color: #0b5fa2; /* Fallback color for readability */
      background-image: url('/img/blue-gradient-background.png');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      font-family: "Roboto", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      flex: 1;
      height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      color: white;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .dl-main-navbar {
      display: flex;
      position: fixed;
      top: -30px;
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .dl-main-navbar-logo {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 26px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    p {
      font-family: 'Roboto', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .doctologo {
      background-image: url("data:image/png;base64,");
    }

    /* Language divs shown via JavaScript based on TLD */
    [class^="lang-"] {
      display: none;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

  </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="container">
      <header class="dl-main-navbar">
        <a href="/">
          <div class="dl-main-navbar-logo doctologo" role="img" aria-label="Doctolib"></div>
        </a>
      </header>
      <section class="lang-fr">
        <h1>Nous sommes désolés, cette page est introuvable.</h1>
        <p>Cette page n'existe peut-être pas, ou le lien est peut-être cassé.<br/>
          Veuillez vérifier l'adresse et réessayer, ou bien revenez à l'accueil.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="lang-de">
        <h1>Es tut uns leid, diese Seite konnte nicht gefunden werden.</h1>
        <p>Diese Seite existiert möglicherweise nicht oder der Link ist defekt.<br/>
          Bitte überprüfen Sie den Link und versuchen Sie es erneut.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="lang-it">
        <h1>Ci dispiace, la pagina non è stata trovata.</h1>
        <p>Questa pagina potrebbe non esistere o il link potrebbe essere danneggiato.<br/>
          Controlla il link e riprova, oppure torna alla pagina iniziale.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="lang-en">
        <h1>We're sorry, this page could not be found.</h1>
        <p>This page may not exist, or the link may be broken. Please check the address and try again, or return to the homepage.</p>
      </section>
  </main>
  <script type="text/javascript">
    // Switch language according to TLD
    const hostname = window.location.hostname;
    const parts = hostname.split(".");
    const tld = parts[parts.length - 1];

    const availableLanguages = ['fr', 'de', 'it'];
    const lang = availableLanguages.includes(tld) ? tld : 'en';
    const langClass = '.lang-' + lang;

    const elements = document.querySelectorAll(langClass);
    elements.forEach(element => {
      element.style.display = 'block';
    });
  </script>
</body>

</html>
